      "text": "@contract: engain.scene_text_packet.v1"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "scene 025.2 — crystalline prison construction"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "scene meta:"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "location: Eastern Excavation Site / Crystalline Chamber"
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "time: year 17,503 (Days after scene 025.1)"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "participants: The Nameless One, The Five (hive-linked), Mika, freed slaves"
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "focus: Over several days, Geralt's possessed body directs the Five to line an excavated pit with hexagonal blue-white crystals and seal it with a massive stone disk; Mika attempts to help Geralt fight the compulsion and learns of the hive network before the chamber is sealed."
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "continuity: Days after scene 025.1"
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "presentation: cutscene"
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "cutscene purpose: Depict the construction of the crystalline communications chamber and Mika's discovery of the hive threat."
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scene Two: The Crystalline Prison"
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Days passed in fractured consciousness."
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One learned to recognize the pattern: freedom came when distance separated him from the five."
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Control returned when proximity demanded their direction."
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His existence split into two distinct states, each as real as the other, neither offering escape from the horror of what he was becoming."
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the main compound, working with the scarred one and the other freed slaves, he was himself."
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The spark burned clear."
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His hands moved with intention he controlled."
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They refined the gesture-language, adding nuance and complexity with each passing day."
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Simple concepts became compound thoughts."
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Individual words became sentences."
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The slaves who had known only grunts and fear began to communicate with sophistication that approached true language."
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Point-group, unity-gesture, strength-motion multiplied"
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(When we stand together, our strength multiplies)"
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Freedom-symbol, not-yet, but-coming, patience-required"
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(True freedom isn't here yet, but it will come if we're patient)"
    },
    {
      "line": 51,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one proved brilliant at this work."
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She grasped patterns quickly, invented new gesture-combinations that conveyed meanings he hadn't considered."
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "More than that, she watched him with sharp attention that cataloged every inconsistency, every moment when his behavior shifted from genuine to something else."
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She knew."
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She'd seen the invasion."
    },
    {
      "line": 57,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And she was gathering evidence of what it had done to him."
    },
    {
      "line": 59,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But when the thing behind his eye decided the five needed direction, when the compulsion rose like tide he couldn't resist, The Nameless One became something else entirely."
    },
    {
      "line": 61,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 63,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His feet carried him to the eastern excavation site without conscious decision."
    },
    {
      "line": 64,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One moment he was teaching gesture-language to a group of attentive slaves."
    },
    {
      "line": 65,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The next, his body simply... redirected."
    },
    {
      "line": 66,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Turned away mid-instruction."
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Walked with purpose toward the place where the five labored."
    },
    {
      "line": 69,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "line": 70,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not now."
    },
    {
      "line": 71,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We were making progress."
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were learning."
    },
    {
      "line": 73,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Don't make me—"
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But his protests were whispers against hurricane."
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The thing behind his eye had decided."
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And when it decided, his body obeyed."
    },
    {
      "line": 79,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The excavation had grown."
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What had started as shallow depression now gaped like wound in the compound's eastern floor—a pit descending twenty feet into earth that showed layers of geological history."
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five worked at the bottom, tools rising and falling with mechanical synchronization that made his stomach churn."
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They looked up as one when he approached."
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five pairs of eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five expressions empty of everything except readiness to serve."
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His throat produced sounds without his permission:"
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sharp bark, attention-command"
    },
    {
      "line": 90,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Stop."
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Listen."
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "New instructions.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five dropped their tools simultaneously."
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rose to their feet with movements that matched perfectly."
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Turned to face him with terrible, patient expectation."
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What crystal?"
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Why do I know about crystal?"
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What are we building?"
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But his hands were already moving, forming gestures with precision that came from knowledge buried deep in the thing's stolen memories:"
    },
    {
      "line": 104,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Crystal-symbol, specific-pattern: hexagonal structure, blue-white luminescence"
    },
    {
      "line": 105,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Find crystalline formations—six-sided, glowing with cold light)"
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Search-motion, excavation-walls, bring-gesture"
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Search the pit walls."
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Extract carefully."
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bring to surface.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five nodded once, synchronized, and turned to their task."
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They moved along the excavation's walls, hands running over exposed stone with focused attention."
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And impossibly—despite this being random pit in ground that should contain nothing but compressed sediment—they found them."
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Crystals."
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Embedded in the wall approximately fifteen feet down, a cluster of hexagonal formations pulsed with faint blue-white light."
    },
    {
      "line": 119,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They shouldn't exist here."
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shouldn't be possible in this geological context."
    },
    {
      "line": 121,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But they were there nonetheless, as though they'd been waiting for someone who knew where to look, who understood their purpose."
    },
    {
      "line": 123,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "How did I know?"
    },
    {
      "line": 124,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "How did IT know?"
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five extracted the crystals with care that bordered on reverence."
    },
    {
      "line": 127,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each formation was roughly the size of a human forearm, perfectly geometric despite being natural growth."
    },
    {
      "line": 128,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They glowed brighter when removed from the surrounding stone, as though responding to being freed, to being claimed for purpose they'd been designed to serve."
    },
    {
      "line": 130,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One watched his hands gesture commands he didn't understand:"
    },
    {
      "line": 132,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Assembly-motion, wall-placement, interior-lining"
    },
    {
      "line": 133,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Attach these to the pit walls."
    },
    {
      "line": 134,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Create interior surface."
    },
    {
      "line": 135,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Line completely.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 137,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "line": 138,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What does this accomplish?"
    },
    {
      "line": 139,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What is this structure?"
    },
    {
      "line": 141,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the five obeyed without question."
    },
    {
      "line": 142,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They descended back into the pit with the extracted crystals and began affixing them to the walls."
    },
    {
      "line": 143,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not with mortar or rope—those would have been logical, comprehensible."
    },
    {
      "line": 144,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instead, they simply pressed the crystals against stone, and the formations... adhered."
    },
    {
      "line": 145,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bonded at molecular level, becoming part of the wall they touched, their glow intensifying with each successful attachment."
    },
    {
      "line": 147,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One tried to step back."
    },
    {
      "line": 148,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tried to walk away before the compulsion made him complicit in more construction he couldn't comprehend."
    },
    {
      "line": 149,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But his body refused."
    },
    {
      "line": 150,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It remained at the pit's edge, supervising, directing, gesturing refinements to placement he shouldn't know mattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 152,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "More, his hands commanded against his will."
    },
    {
      "line": 153,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Complete coverage."
    },
    {
      "line": 154,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No gaps."
    },
    {
      "line": 155,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Perfect alignment."
    },
    {
      "line": 156,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Cover every surface."
    },
    {
      "line": 157,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Leave no space between formations."
    },
    {
      "line": 158,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Precision is critical.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 160,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hours passed."
    },
    {
      "line": 161,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five worked with tireless efficiency, never pausing for rest, never showing fatigue."
    },
    {
      "line": 162,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "More crystals were found—impossible, but true."
    },
    {
      "line": 163,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The pit walls gradually transformed from bare stone to glowing surface that pulsed with cold light, creating chamber that looked less like excavation and more like something deliberately constructed."
    },
    {
      "line": 165,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And The Nameless One stood there, trapped in his own skull, watching his hands direct construction of something that terrified him on instinctive level he couldn't articulate."
    },
    {
      "line": 167,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This is wrong."
    },
    {
      "line": 168,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This is dangerous."
    },
    {
      "line": 169,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Whatever we're building... it shouldn't exist."
    },
    {
      "line": 171,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the thing behind his eye knew better."
    },
    {
      "line": 172,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Knew exactly what this chamber would become."
    },
    {
      "line": 173,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Knew its purpose with certainty born from programming older than human consciousness."
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 177,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Finally—mercifully—the compulsion released."
    },
    {
      "line": 179,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One gasped, stumbling backward from the pit's edge as control returned with shocking abruptness."
    },
    {
      "line": 180,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His hands were his again."
    },
    {
      "line": 181,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His thoughts clarified."
    },
    {
      "line": 182,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The weight behind his eye remained, but dormant, satisfied with the day's progress."
    },
    {
      "line": 184,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked down at the crystalline chamber the five had created and felt horror so profound it transcended language."
    },
    {
      "line": 186,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was beautiful."
    },
    {
      "line": 187,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Terrible."
    },
    {
      "line": 188,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "line": 190,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The pit had become womb—walls lined completely with hexagonal crystals that pulsed with rhythmic light, creating environment that felt both ancient and impossibly advanced."
    },
    {
      "line": 191,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The glow cast strange shadows that seemed to move independently of any light source."
    },
    {
      "line": 192,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air above the chamber shimmered with heat distortion that shouldn't exist given the crystals' cold luminescence."
    },
    {
      "line": 194,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And the five stood at the chamber's center, looking up at him with empty eyes, waiting for next command that would make them complete whatever this structure's purpose demanded."
    },
    {
      "line": 196,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What have I made them build?"
    },
    {
      "line": 197,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What have I created?"
    },
    {
      "line": 199,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One turned and fled before the compulsion could return."
    },
    {
      "line": 200,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ran back toward the main compound where the scarred one waited, where slaves practiced gesture-language, where he could pretend to be the person he remembered being rather than the thing he was becoming."
    },
    {
      "line": 202,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She looked up as he approached, and her expression shifted immediately from teaching-focus to sharp concern."
    },
    {
      "line": 203,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her hands formed question before conscious thought:"
    },
    {
      "line": 205,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Quick gestures, worry-evident"
    },
    {
      "line": 206,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(What happened?"
    },
    {
      "line": 207,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You look... wrong.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 209,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He couldn't explain."
    },
    {
      "line": 210,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Couldn't form gestures sophisticated enough to convey the horror of being puppeted, of watching yourself become instrument of purpose you couldn't comprehend."
    },
    {
      "line": 211,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His hands trembled as they formed inadequate response:"
    },
    {
      "line": 213,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Building-gesture, wrongness-symbol, fear"
    },
    {
      "line": 214,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Made them build something."
    },
    {
      "line": 215,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Don't know what."
    },
    {
      "line": 216,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scared.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 218,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one's eyes narrowed."
    },
    {
      "line": 219,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She glanced past him toward the eastern excavation site, then back to his face with expression that suggested she understood more than he'd communicated."
    },
    {
      "line": 221,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Controlled-symbol, eye-point, thing-inside"
    },
    {
      "line": 222,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(The infection controls you?"
    },
    {
      "line": 223,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Makes you command them?)"
    },
    {
      "line": 225,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He nodded, grateful she understood, terrified by how much she'd already pieced together."
    },
    {
      "line": 227,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She studied him for long moment, then made decision."
    },
    {
      "line": 228,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her hands moved with authority:"
    },
    {
      "line": 230,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Distance-gesture, stay-away, five-symbol"
    },
    {
      "line": 231,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Stay away from them."
    },
    {
      "line": 232,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When compulsion comes, resist."
    },
    {
      "line": 233,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stay here.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 235,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I can't, his hands formed desperately."
    },
    {
      "line": 236,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It's stronger."
    },
    {
      "line": 237,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When it decides, I just... move."
    },
    {
      "line": 238,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Unable to resist."
    },
    {
      "line": 239,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Body obeys without permission.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 241,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one's jaw tightened."
    },
    {
      "line": 242,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then she gestured something that surprised him:"
    },
    {
      "line": 244,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Alliance-symbol, watch-motion, protect"
    },
    {
      "line": 245,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(I'll watch."
    },
    {
      "line": 246,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When you start to leave, I'll know."
    },
    {
      "line": 247,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I'll help you fight it.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 249,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hope flickered."
    },
    {
      "line": 250,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Small."
    },
    {
      "line": 251,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fragile."
    },
    {
      "line": 252,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But present."
    },
    {
      "line": 254,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thank you, his hands formed with emphasis that transcended gesture."
    },
    {
      "line": 255,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Don't know what I'd do without—"
    },
    {
      "line": 257,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The weight behind his eye suddenly intensified."
    },
    {
      "line": 258,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The compulsion rose like wave."
    },
    {
      "line": 259,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And despite everything—despite the scarred one's offered help, despite his desperate resistance—his body turned toward the eastern pit."
    },
    {
      "line": 261,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one's hand shot out, grabbing his wrist."
    },
    {
      "line": 262,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her grip was surprisingly strong for someone who'd survived starvation and brutality."
    },
    {
      "line": 263,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her eyes met his with fierce determination:"
    },
    {
      "line": 265,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No-symbol, emphatic, repeated"
    },
    {
      "line": 266,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Fight it!"
    },
    {
      "line": 267,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stay!)"
    },
    {
      "line": 269,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He tried."
    },
    {
      "line": 270,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Truly tried."
    },
    {
      "line": 271,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Focused every fragment of will on remaining still, on not taking that first step that would lead him back to the five, back to the crystalline chamber, back to being puppet for consciousness he couldn't resist."
    },
    {
      "line": 273,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For a moment—glorious, temporary—he succeeded."
    },
    {
      "line": 274,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His feet remained planted."
    },
    {
      "line": 275,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The compulsion pushed but didn't move him."
    },
    {
      "line": 277,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the thing behind his eye adjusted."
    },
    {
      "line": 278,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Recalibrated."
    },
    {
      "line": 279,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And his body simply... overrode his resistance with force that made his previous attempts feel like child pushing against mountain."
    },
    {
      "line": 281,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His wrist tore free of the scarred one's grip."
    },
    {
      "line": 282,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His feet carried him forward despite her pursuing attempt to restrain him."
    },
    {
      "line": 283,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He heard her frustrated grunt—sound of one who'd tried to help and watched that help fail—but couldn't turn to acknowledge it."
    },
    {
      "line": 285,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five waited at the pit's edge."
    },
    {
      "line": 286,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They'd climbed out while he was gone, standing in perfect formation, tools forgotten, focused entirely on his approaching form."
    },
    {
      "line": 288,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Completion-gesture, final-assembly"
    },
    {
      "line": 289,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Time to finish."
    },
    {
      "line": 290,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Seal the chamber.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 292,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "NO!"
    },
    {
      "line": 293,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I don't want this!"
    },
    {
      "line": 294,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stop making me—"
    },
    {
      "line": 296,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But his hands continued their traitorous gestures:"
    },
    {
      "line": 298,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Large-stone, specific-shape: flat, heavy, circular"
    },
    {
      "line": 299,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Find a stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 300,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Must be round."
    },
    {
      "line": 301,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Must be thick enough to seal completely.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 303,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five scattered to search."
    },
    {
      "line": 304,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And The Nameless One stood there, watching them obey commands he hadn't chosen to give, building toward purpose that terrified him more with each passing moment."
    },
    {
      "line": 306,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one reached his position, breathing hard from her pursuit."
    },
    {
      "line": 307,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her hands grabbed his shoulders, forcing him to look at her:"
    },
    {
      "line": 309,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Desperate gestures"
    },
    {
      "line": 310,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(What is it making you build?"
    },
    {
      "line": 311,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What happens when it's finished?)"
    },
    {
      "line": 313,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His hands formed answer before he could stop them—speaking truth the thing behind his eye wanted shared:"
    },
    {
      "line": 315,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Communication-symbol, connection-gesture, network-representation"
    },
    {
      "line": 316,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Chamber for communication."
    },
    {
      "line": 317,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Connection to others like the thing inside me."
    },
    {
      "line": 318,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Network activation.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 320,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Horror bloomed across the scarred one's face as understanding crystalized."
    },
    {
      "line": 322,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Others-symbol, question-urgent"
    },
    {
      "line": 323,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(More of these things exist?"
    },
    {
      "line": 324,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "More infected hosts?)"
    },
    {
      "line": 326,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His possessed hands gestured affirmation that made her step backward:"
    },
    {
      "line": 328,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Many-symbol, scattered-motion, waiting-gesture"
    },
    {
      "line": 329,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Many."
    },
    {
      "line": 330,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scattered everywhere."
    },
    {
      "line": 331,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "All waiting to reconnect.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 333,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then, because the thing apparently wanted her to understand completely:"
    },
    {
      "line": 335,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hive-symbol, mind-connection, control-network"
    },
    {
      "line": 336,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Hive mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 337,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Linked consciousness."
    },
    {
      "line": 338,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Control structure that transcends individual hosts.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 340,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one looked toward the five—synchronized, empty, waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 341,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then back at The Nameless One with expression that mixed horror and determination in equal measure."
    },
    {
      "line": 343,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her hands formed statement that would define everything that followed:"
    },
    {
      "line": 345,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fight-symbol, together-gesture, break-connection"
    },
    {
      "line": 346,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(We fight this."
    },
    {
      "line": 347,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Together."
    },
    {
      "line": 348,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We find way to break the link.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 350,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One wanted to agree."
    },
    {
      "line": 351,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wanted to believe resistance was possible."
    },
    {
      "line": 352,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But his possessed body was already turning away, watching the five return with massive stone disk that shouldn't have been possible for beings their size to move."
    },
    {
      "line": 354,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Yet they moved it."
    },
    {
      "line": 355,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Together."
    },
    {
      "line": 356,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Synchronized."
    },
    {
      "line": 357,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their combined strength amplified by coordination that suggested single consciousness directing multiple bodies."
    },
    {
      "line": 359,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They positioned the stone above the crystalline chamber."
    },
    {
      "line": 360,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And The Nameless One's hands gestured the command that would complete construction:"
    },
    {
      "line": 362,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Seal-motion, finality-gesture"
    },
    {
      "line": 363,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Lower it."
    },
    {
      "line": 364,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Seal the chamber."
    },
    {
      "line": 365,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Work is finished.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 367,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five obeyed."
    },
    {
      "line": 369,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stone descended into position with grinding sound that echoed across the compound."
    },
    {
      "line": 370,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It settled perfectly—too perfectly, edges aligning with crystal-lined walls in ways that suggested either impossible precision or reality adjusting to accommodate purpose it couldn't resist."
    },
    {
      "line": 372,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The crystalline chamber was complete."
    },
    {
      "line": 374,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And somewhere in the depths of that glowing prison, something waited to be activated."
    },
    {
      "line": 376,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The compulsion released."
    },
    {
      "line": 377,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One collapsed to his knees, gasping, free again but horrified by what freedom had cost."
    },
    {
      "line": 379,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one knelt beside him."
    },
    {
      "line": 380,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her hand on his shoulder was anchor—reminder that he wasn't alone, that someone saw what was happening, that witness existed even if help remained beyond reach."
    },
    {
      "line": 382,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rest, her hands formed gently."
    },
    {
      "line": 383,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I'm here."
    },
    {
      "line": 384,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You're not alone in this."
    },
    {
      "line": 386,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But The Nameless One stared at the sealed chamber and knew with terrible certainty:"
    },
    {
      "line": 388,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soon—very soon—the thing behind his eye would make him enter that crystalline prison."
    },
    {
      "line": 390,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Would make him activate whatever waited inside."
    },
    {
      "line": 392,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Would connect him to network that would transform him from individual consciousness into node in hive-mind he couldn't escape."
    },
    {
      "line": 394,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And when that happened, the person he'd been—the spark that had survived slavery and suffering and invasion—might disappear completely."
    },
    {
      "line": 396,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Replaced by something that served purposes he would never understand, directed by will that was ancient and patient and utterly without mercy."
    },
    {
      "line": 398,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five stood at the chamber's edge, empty eyes reflecting crystal-glow, waiting for commands that would come when the thing behind his eye decided preparation was complete."
    },
    {
      "line": 400,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And The Nameless One knelt on cold stone, free for the moment but knowing that freedom was temporary condition granted by parasite that would revoke it whenever service was required."
    },
    {
      "line": 402,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one's hand remained on his shoulder."
    },
    {
      "line": 404,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And somewhere in the compound, freed slaves practiced gesture-language, unaware that their teacher was being hollowed out one command at a time, transformed into instrument of consciousness that would use their revolution for purposes none of them could comprehend."
    },
    {
      "line": 406,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The crystalline chamber pulsed with cold light."
    },
    {
      "line": 408,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 410,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Patient."
    },
    {
      "line": 412,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Inevitable."
    },
    {
      "line": 414,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 416,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "~Year 17,503 (3 days after scene 025.2)"
    }
  ],
